WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.980 --> 00:00:06.720
What's up everybody!

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:07.580
We are Pongfinity

00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:10.420
And today we have come up with a new way of table tennis.

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:12.240
Triangle table tennis!

00:00:15.460 --> 00:00:18.480
The rules are the same as in table tennis but with two exceptions

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:21.440
You're not allowed to hit the ball back twice to the same player

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:24.700
And first serve to the left, second serve to the right

00:00:36.220 --> 00:00:37.960
No! It was Otto's point!

00:01:10.200 --> 00:01:11.320
That was good one!

00:01:11.360 --> 00:01:12.400
Sorry Emil!

00:02:16.980 --> 00:02:18.740
That counts, that counts!

00:02:38.440 --> 00:02:39.500
You set me up Otto!

00:02:39.580 --> 00:02:40.860
Pretty easy serve!

00:02:55.800 --> 00:02:58.940
From this net, to this net, to your side

00:03:54.460 --> 00:03:56.260
I was serving to you!

00:04:35.220 --> 00:04:36.720
No way!

00:04:54.200 --> 00:04:55.800
Nice!

00:04:56.640 --> 00:04:58.500
Good match!

00:04:59.480 --> 00:05:01.840
As always, Otto won.

00:05:01.880 --> 00:05:03.240
But we had a lot of fun.

00:05:03.380 --> 00:05:04.560
Yes we did.

00:05:04.780 --> 00:05:06.260
Remember to subscribe

00:05:06.260 --> 00:05:07.700
And watch our previous videos.

00:05:07.920 --> 00:05:09.180
Until next time!

